pattern_comp restates pattern_exh's pmatch_list_LENGTH with the
two sides of its conclusion the other way round, and this
section was written to prove the one from the other.  Keyed by
the name of the source it named no theorem of the file and did
nothing; keyed by the binding it reads as a proof of the theorem
from itself, which does not even compile.  What it wants is
pattern_exh's theorem and a symmetry step, and that is phase
three: it is out until then.

### pmatch_list_LENGTH
  (MESON_TAC[pattern_comp_pmatch_list_LENGTH])
